  "note": "Fill the `text` of everything marked todo: lines, chapters, the title, the description, the tags. The rest already has a current translation. Keep `id`, `scene`, `source` and `todo` as they are. `thumbnail.text` holds the words of this locale's own thumbnail, one for each word in `thumbnail.source` (tag, headline, sub): short enough to read on a phone, with the same `**` emphasis and line breaks. `glossary.terms` are the dictionary terms this video uses, in the forms they appear in, and `glossary.sources` the names of its sources: render each one way everywhere, a product, company, model or feature name as its maker writes it. `boundaries` maps a line id to the pieces the narration's captions cut that line into (a line absent from it is one cue): keep the clauses in that order.",
  "title": {
    "todo": true,
    "source": "Seiko45萬的錶，為何還得回廠調整？｜品牌故事",
    "text": ""
  },
  "description": {
    "todo": true,
    "source": "一支新石英錶能走得準，為什麼仍可能回廠調整？從1960年代末顯微鏡下的手焊基板，沿著振子與馬達的小型化、1969年出貨改價、老化與爐溫現場檢查，走到後期分頻晶片，以及1977技術文裡的可維修接法。\n\n上市與製程事件依精工／Epson回顧、2004企業史摘錄、2017青木茂技術史及1977安川英昭論文，各守時期與歸屬。沒有把多件回廠錶拼成一支可追蹤序號案例；兩成是振子初期良率，一成是特定階段IC挑選比例，並非退貨率。精度保留常溫條件；汽車價只比較1966東京卡羅拉Standard。初代hybrid、35SQ外購Intersil分頻晶片、自研A型與1971年12月38系，以及1977實裝，各守機種與時期。舊題瑞士產業單因果與全球免費專利說法不採。圖為匿名概念插畫。\n\n原件來源（查閱2026-10-26）\nセイコー クオーツアストロン 35SQ | 企業情報 | エプソン\nhttps://corporate.epson/ja/about/history/milestone-products/1969-12-35sq.html\n今に生きるセイコー クオーツアストロンの偉業 | Astron（アストロン） | セイコーウオッチ\nhttps://www.seikowatches.com/jp-ja/products/astron/special/story_qa50th_1\nMilestones:Electronic Quartz Wristwatch, 1969 - Engineering and Technology History Wiki\nhttps://ethw.org/Milestones:Electronic_Quartz_Wristwatch,_1969\nS7_SHMJ\nhttps://www.shmj.or.jp/dev_story/devdigest/epson/epson_02.pdf\nトヨタカローラ発表\r\n価格はスタンダードで43万2千円（東京） | トヨタ自動車株式会社 公式企業サイト\nhttps://global.toyota/jp/detail/14002042/\nS20_YASUKAWA1977\nhttps://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/jjspe1933/43/513/43_513_998/_pdf\nS24_KAHAKU_REPORT\nhttps://sts.kahaku.go.jp/albums/abm.php?d=3277&f=abm00011060.pdf&n=102.pdf",
    "text": ""
  },
